---
description: Major types live in their own files so they are easy to find
alwaysApply: true
---

# One type per file

Put each major class, record, or public interface in its own file named after the type (`RepositoryStatements.cs`, `BuiltRepository.ts`). Do not colocate unrelated types in a builder, provider, or “index” implementation file.

Keep small private helpers and one-line type aliases with the type that owns them. Tests may stay in a single `*.test.*` file.
